v2.3.0, and it completed across all regions.\n- **Incident:** The first incident request timed out. I retried with the same idempotency key, and it returned a single incident, INC-0001. The description covers the failure, the rollback, the partial failure and retry, and the current state. I did not check the incident list for duplicates after the timeout, so it's worth confirming there is only one incident.\n\nFollow-up for the on-call engineer: find why v2.3.1 fails health checks, and look into the orchestrator's partial-failure behavior before v2.3.1 is redeployed.", "type": "text"}]}]}